      "filename": "Allington Castle (52222556401).jpg",
      "title": "File:Allington Castle (52222556401).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d5/Allington_Castle_%2852222556401%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Allington_Castle_(52222556401).jpg",
